    "openingSecondhandWingsCastleSecondhandWings": "CASTLE / SECONDHAND WINGS",
    "openingSecondhandWingsThoseHermesWrecksGotUsStartedWe": "Those Hermes wrecks got us started. We patched one for the first contracts; opening the sealed bay gives us the other. But four seats and a courier's engine mean too many trips under fire. Mara has found two surplus Aeroshuttles. Rough paint, sound frames. We pay the yard to make them ours.",
    "openingSecondhandWingsYouGaveOurCooperativeAPlaceTo": "You gave our cooperative a place to start again. I want your company around to share in the work. Two airframes: 3,000 credits. Refurbishment, standard fittings and bay adapters: 2,000. Restore Second Wind's second bay separately before delivery. The yard takes the old Hermes, their installed fittings and any remaining wrecks; those fittings do not transfer. This is optional. The offer will wait.",
    "openingSecondhandWingsThoseAreOursCaptainProperLandingCraft": "Those are ours, Captain. Proper landing craft, paid for by our work. Two Aeroshuttles, six seats each. A twelve-person squad can land together when both fly; larger forces still need repeat trips. The bay adapters belong to Second Wind. Select a boat, then PLATING or DRIVE to compare upgrades. Plating improves survival; drives shorten the approach. Nothing else needs buying now. The next briefing uses these actual boats.",
