    "openingCerberusCompanyStartYourCompanyIsReadyCommanderTheFirst": "Your company is ready, Commander. The first story contract on Jangala is waiting in Headquarters. Any unused depot stores remain here for our return.",
    "openingCerberusCompanyStartOurShipIsHomeNowStayDocked": "Our ship is home now. Stay docked here while we use the prepaid stores: repair the first wrecked Hermes that came with her on the Boat Deck, meet Mira in Barracks and choose her first specialty, then muster a squad in the Armory and assign it to her. I will walk you through each order.",
    "openingCerberusCompanyStartAnAccessiblePlanetarySpaceport": "an accessible planetary spaceport",
    "openingCerberusCompanyStartFirstWeNeedMercenaryCompanyConversionOur": "First we need Mercenary Company Conversion: our permanent barracks and workshop, costing 5,000 credits. {0}Choose Return, dock at {1}, then choose Marine operations in the planet menu. I will bring up the yard order for you. This is not Additional Berthing or an item in the standard Refit picker. We must finish the conversion before designating our command vessel; our prepaid preparation stores will wait in the planetary depot.",
