    "openingCerberusCompanyStartTheConversionIsInstalledStayDockedAt": "The conversion is installed. Stay docked at {0} and open Marine operations, then choose our Cerberus as the company command vessel. The preparation bill includes our finite depot stock while we are docked here. Then we will repair the first Hermes, meet Mira and muster her squad.",
