    "openingCompanyFoundingIntelCastleCompanyOfficer": "CASTLE / COMPANY OFFICER",
    "openingCompanyFoundingIntelSecondWindCarriedYourCrewOffHarker": "Second Wind carried your crew off Harker's Claim, an independent mining asteroid abandoned by its operator. The departure roster still has Castle's additions in the margin. Everyone on it is counting on this ship lasting long enough to earn a living.",
    "openingCompanyFoundingIntelCastleSContactOnJangalaIsNessa": "Castle's contact on Jangala is Nessa Venn, a yard forewoman from her old ore runs. Nessa has agreed to take on the conversion and hold your prepaid stores.",
